OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers suffer 'hardest summer in
OL,4,Agenerations'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers in Derbyshire are counting the
OL,7,Fcost of the UK's hottest summer on
OL,8,Frecord, with one dubbing it the
OL,9,F"hardest summer in generations".
OL,11,FAmy Wheelton, from Walton-on-Trent,
OL,12,Fsaid there were "real issues" including
OL,13,Frising fuel bills and fertiliser costs.
OL,15,FWheelton, who is also a Derbyshire
OL,16,FIndependents county councillor, said a
OL,17,F"margin squeeze" was contributing to
OL,18,Ffarmers "stopping growing crops and
OL,19,Fretiring".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
