OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers suffer 'hardest summer in
OL,4,Agenerations'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I watched my really good crop of
OL,7,Fwinter beans die in the first heatwave,
OL,8,Fall my grassland has been burnt off,"
OL,9,Fshe said, adding that juvenile
OL,10,Fhedgerows and trees she planted last
OL,11,Fyear have died.
